{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439","id":3370036118,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7I3quW","number":1439,"title":"关于 Trae 开发时服务器内存占用过高问题的反馈","user":{"login":"mochendong","id":102901181,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiIlvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102901181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong","html_url":"https://github.com/mochendong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2025-08-31T09:03:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T15:25:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"问题描述\n在使用 Trae 进行程序开发过程中，通过远程 SSH 连接服务器时频繁出现内存耗尽导致服务器宕机的情况。\n服务器配置详情：\nCPU：4 核\n内存：4GB\n操作系统：Ubuntu 22.04\n具体现象\n开发过程中内存占用持续上涨，直至达到 4GB 上限\n内存耗尽后服务器无响应，需要强制重启\n问题可复现，并非偶发情况\n希望了解的信息\nTrae 软件正常运行时建议的内存配置是多少？\n为什么在开发过程中会出现内存持续上涨且不释放的情况？\n这种内存持续增长是否属于软件 bug？\n是否有临时解决方案或配置调整建议可以避免服务器宕机？\n补充说明\n目前 4GB 内存的服务器在运行其他开发工具时均能正常工作，仅在使用 Trae 开发时出现此类内存问题。\n希望开发团队能针对此问题进行排查，并提供相应的解决方案或优化建议，避免因内存耗尽导致的开发中断。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3239934876","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439#issuecomment-3239934876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439","id":3239934876,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7BHXuc","user":{"login":"mochendong","id":102901181,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiIlvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102901181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong","html_url":"https://github.com/mochendong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T09:03:41Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T09:03:41Z","body":"关于 Trae 远程开发时 4GB 内存仍耗尽问题的补充反馈\n结合 Trae 官方文档中 “远程主机推荐 2 核 2GB 配置” 的说明，我在 4 核 4GB 服务器（Ubuntu 22.04）上仍频繁出现内存持续上涨直至宕机的问题，具体补充如下：\n一、核心矛盾：实际占用与官方建议的差异\n根据官方文档《使用 SSH 开发》章节明确说明：“远程主机系统配置：至少 1GB RAM，更推荐 2GB 和 2-core CPU 的组合”。我的服务器配置（4 核 4GB）已远超推荐标准，但问题仍持续发生，排除了 “配置未达基础要求” 的可能性。\n二、当前问题的关键细节补充\n内存占用规律：并非启动即耗尽，而是在开发过程中（如使用代码补全、调试、AI 辅助功能时）逐步上涨，且上涨后未出现明显释放，最终直至 4GB 内存完全占满导致宕机。\n环境排除：服务器仅运行 Trae 服务端及必要 SSH 服务，未同时部署其他高内存应用；且已确认远程主机满足文档要求的 “出站 HTTPS（443 端口）访问能力”，无网络通信导致的异常阻塞。\n功能关联性：观察发现，当频繁使用 Trae 的 AI 相关功能（如 Inline Chat、代码自动补全）时，内存上涨速度明显加快；若仅进行基础文件编辑，内存占用增长相对缓慢。\n三、需要开发团队协助排查的方向\n是否存在功能特定的内存泄漏：官方推荐配置是否未充分考虑 “高频使用 AI 功能” 等场景？是否存在部分功能（如 AI 后端、调试器）运行时未正确释放内存的情况？\n服务端进程异常占用：Trae 服务端在远程主机上的后台进程（如 AI 后端、工作区插件）是否存在进程残留、资源未回收的问题？是否有特定操作会触发进程内存堆积？\n扩展或兼容性问题：是否因远程主机上安装的某些 Trae 插件（尤其是第三方插件）与服务端存在冲突，导致内存管理异常？\n配置参数缺失：是否需要在 Trae 中手动配置内存使用上限（如服务端进程内存阈值），而文档中未提及该配置项？\n希望开发团队能结合以上细节，针对 “超配情况下仍内存耗尽” 的异常场景进一步排查，明确是否为软件功能漏洞、配置缺失或特定操作触发的问题，并提供对应的修复方案或临时规避建议。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3239934876/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3239959417","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439#issuecomment-3239959417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1439","id":3239959417,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7BHdt5","user":{"login":"mochendong","id":102901181,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiIlvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102901181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong","html_url":"https://github.com/mochendong","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mochendong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/